  - text: ...
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c19b252c3ea4ae44dbe8b2b78b1186e7, type: 2}
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    characterPos: 0
    characterSprite2: {fileID: 0}
    characterPos2: 0
  - text: What does it want of this world..?
